{
  "engine_version": "0.1.0",
  "internal_sample_rate": 96000,
  "seed": 20260731,
  "output": { "sample_rate": 0, "format": "pcm24" },

  "_why": [
    "Written from the measured spectrum of acoustic-guitar-track.wav, not from",
    "a genre convention. Every move below names the number that motivated it.",
    "",
    "Measured: true peak +0.52 dBTP (already clipping on conversion), PLR",
    "25.4 dB (very dynamic, unprocessed), HF rolloff -3.9 dB/oct (bright, not",
    "dark), and a broad +7 to +9 dB hump across 200-315 Hz relative to the",
    "500 Hz - 4 kHz average, peaking at 250 Hz.",
    "",
    "Two things the vocal chain got wrong here, both visible in that data:",
    "the 90 Hz high-pass cuts into the 80 Hz band, which sits +3.5 dB and",
    "holds the low E fundamental at 82 Hz; and the +2.5 dB air shelf pushes a",
    "source whose top end is already gently sloped rather than dark."
  ],

  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "rumble",
      "type": "parametric_eq",
      "params": {
        "bands": [
          { "filter_type": "highpass", "center_freq_hz": 50,
            "gain_db": 0, "q_factor": 0.707 }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "body",
      "type": "parametric_eq",
      "params": {
        "bands": [
          { "filter_type": "bell", "center_freq_hz": 250,
            "gain_db": -4.0, "q_factor": 0.9 },
          { "filter_type": "bell", "center_freq_hz": 125,
            "gain_db": -1.5, "q_factor": 1.2 }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "level",
      "type": "compressor",
      "params": {
        "threshold_dbfs": -22.0,
        "ratio_to_1": 2.2,
        "knee_db": 10.0,
        "attack_ms": 30.0,
        "release_ms": 180.0,
        "makeup_gain_db": 3.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "space",
      "type": "plate_reverb",
      "mix": 0.1,
      "params": {
        "decay_s": 1.2,
        "pre_delay_ms": 30.0,
        "damping_hz": 5500.0,
        "bandwidth_hz": 11000.0
      }
    }
  ],

  "master": [
    {
      "id": "ceiling",
      "type": "true_peak_limiter",
      "params": {
        "ceiling_dbtp": -1.0,
        "lookahead_ms": 5.0,
        "release_ms": 90.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "word_length",
      "type": "dither",
      "params": { "bit_depth": 24, "amount_lsb": 2.0 }
    }
  ]
}
